@title Dragon Ball Z - The Legacy of Goku II (USA)
@file Dragon Ball Z - The Legacy of Goku II (U) [!].gba
@game ALFE
@chip EEPROM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: nothing is written to EEPROM through the Trunks prologue and the start of the present-day chapter; the pause menu has no Save, the game saves only at Save Points and none was found yet. Reached kid Gohan in Goku's Home, where Chi-Chi stops him at the front door until he finds his Mathbook ("I've already asked you N times") and puts him back by the door after every talk; the book was not found

# New Game > the story > Gohan's training (melee boulder, energy-blast
# boulder, the Super Saiyan cutscene) > "Stay here, I'll take care of them" >
# up through the notch in the north cliff to Gohan (A from his right side) >
# the rain scene > the Flight Circle on the plateau (stand on it, A) >
# Pepper Town ruins (north edge, east into the plaza, north into the street,
# west to the puddle) > Gohan's last stand > "Present day Earth..." > Goku's
# Home: Gohan's room, down into the kitchen.
# Finding: nba rolls different stats for Trunks (pause > Status at f9315 of
# an earlier session: nba HP 148/148, EP 27/31, STR 11, POW 9, END 7;
# dingbat-bios and mgba HP 145/145, EP 34/34, STR 12, POW 8, END 8), and its
# HUD energy bar is visibly shorter from the end of the training on; nba also
# needed more A taps to leave the second story page (16 against 10) and runs
# a few frames late in fades and text boxes. dingbat-bios matches mgba.

